<title>USA: Avid Technology president Keshian resigns.</title>
<headline>Avid Technology president Keshian resigns.</headline>
<dateline>TEWKSBURY, Mass. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avid Technology Inc said Daniel Keshian resigned as president, effective September 30, to pursue other business opportunities.</p>
<p>Keshian has served as president since January.</p>
<p>Bill Miller, Avid's chairman and chief executive, will assume responsibility for all corporate operations, the company said.</p>
<p>Avid develops and supplies all-digital solutions for creating, editing and distributing media.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
